{"step_index":56,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-02T19:28:45Z","content":"# Criminal Network Intelligence Visualizer\n\nA single-file, production-grade React dashboard engineered with **TailwindCSS** and **`react-cytoscapejs`** to visualize syndicate structures, illicit communication links, and transaction flows in a law-enforcement dark-mode UI.\n\n---\n\n### Key Capabilities\n\n```\n┌────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐\n│  TOP BAR: Status Indicator | Threat Level | Graph Controls (Fit, Refresh, Reset)       │\n├───────────────────────────────┬────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤\n│  SIDEBAR: Anomalies & Alerts  │  CENTRAL CANVAS: Cytoscape Graph Canvas               │\n│  - Severity Badges (Crit/Hi) │  - Person: Red Circles                                  │\n│  - Anomaly descriptions       │  - Phone: Blue Squares                                 │\n│  - Click to highlight target  │  - Account: Green Triangles                            │\n│                               │  - Directed Edges (Arrows)                             │\n│                               │  - Force-directed COSE Layout                          │\n│                               ├────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤\n│                               │  OVERLAY: Node Properties Inspector                    │\n│                               │  - Entity ID, Label, Type, Risk Score, Neighbors       │\n└───────────────────────────────┴────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘\n```\n\n---\n\n### Prerequisites & Dependencies\n\nTo run this in a Vite + React project:\n\n```bash\nnpm install cytoscape react-cytoscapejs\n```\n\nEnsure Tailwind CSS is enabled in your `tailwind.config.js`:\n\n```javascript\n/** @type {import('tailwindcss').Config} */\nexport default {\n  content: [\"./index.html\", \"./src/**/*.{js,ts,jsx,tsx}\"],\n  darkMode: 'class',\n  theme: {\n    extend: {},\n  },\n  plugins: [],\n}\n```\n\n---\n\n### Complete Single-File Component: `CriminalNetworkDashboard.jsx`\n\n```jsx\nimport React, { useState, useEffect, useRef, useMemo } from 'react';\nimport CytoscapeComponent from 'react-cytoscapejs';\n\n// =====================================================================\n// Realistic Fallback Data (Used when Backend APIs are Offline)\n// =====================================================================\n\nconst FALLBACK_GRAPH_ELEMENTS = [\n  // --- PERSON NODES (Red Circles) ---\n  { data: { id: 'p1', label: \"Viktor 'The Ghost' Vance\", type: 'person', role: 'Syndicate Leader', risk: 'CRITICAL', status: 'Active Target' } },\n  { data: { id: 'p2', label: 'Elena Rostova', type: 'person', role: 'Logistics Coordinator', risk: 'HIGH', status: 'Surveillance' } },\n  { data: { id: 'p3', label: 'Dmitri Volkov', type: 'person', role: 'Enforcer / Operations', risk: 'CRITICAL', status: 'Arrest Warrant' } },\n  { data: { id: 'p4', label: 'Marcus Vance', type: 'person', role: 'Corporate Front Director', risk: 'MEDIUM', status: 'Under Investigation' } },\n  { data: { id: 'p5', label: 'Sarah Chen', type: 'person', role: 'Financial Smurfer / Mule', risk: 'MEDIUM', status: 'Identified' } },\n\n  // --- PHONE NODES (Blue Squares) ---\n  { data: { id: 'ph1', label: '+1 (555) 019-4821 [Burner Alpha]', type: 'phone', carrier: 'T-Cell PPD', imei: '864291048201928' } },\n  { data: { id: 'ph2', label: '+1 (555) 014-9982 [Burner Beta]', type: 'phone', carrier: 'Metro SIM', imei: '359182049182049' } },\n  { data: { id: 'ph3', label: '+1 (555) 017-3310 [VoIP Trunk]', type: 'phone', carrier: 'SignalMesh Global', imei: 'N/A (Virtual IP)' } },\n  { data: { id: 'ph4', label: '+1 (555) 012-7804 [Encrypted Sat]', type: 'phone', carrier: 'Thuraya Satellite', imei: '440182940182941' } },\n\n  // --- ACCOUNT NODES (Green Triangles) ---\n  { data: { id: 'acc1', label: 'SWIFT // CH-9804-CY [Cayman Offshore]', type: 'a